@startuml j7-import-export
!include c4-sequence.iuml
title J7 Load a shop file or a CSV, and export
actor "Owner" as O <<person>>
box "Hisaab in the browser"
participant "The + menu\n(compact.js)" as M <<component>>
participant "Shop file\n(app.js)" as H <<container>>
participant "Import checks\n(guard.js)" as G <<component>>
database "Browser storage\n(localStorage)" as S <<store>>
end box
participant "Downloads\non the device" as D <<external>>
== Load ==
O -> M : tap "+", then "Import a shop"
O -> H : paste a shop file (JSON) or a CSV into the box,\nor use "Choose file"; press "Load shop"
H -> H : read it; clean phones, kinds, amounts and dates;\nskip the rows that cannot be used
note right of H : the file is read in the browser;\nnothing is uploaded
H -> S : the loaded shop replaces the current one
G -> S : round amounts with paise to whole rupees;\nleave out pictures that are not images or are too large
H --> O : "Loaded {shop}: {c} customers, {e} entries.", what was skipped,\nand "Shop loaded." with "Undo"
opt the wrong file
  O -> H : tap "Undo"
  H -> S : put the earlier shop back
end
== Export ==
O -> H : press "Export entries (CSV)", "Export balances (CSV)"\nor "Backup file (JSON)"
H -> D : a file named after the shop is downloaded
note over D : the backup file is the only copy\noutside this browser
@enduml
